## Key Integrations and Channels

Spotler Engage connects communication channels and conversations into one environment.

### Social media platforms and messaging channels

Supported channels include:

- WhatsApp
- Facebook
- Instagram
- LinkedIn
- X / Twitter
- TikTok
- Threads

Important channel logic:

- Facebook supports publishing and managing Messenger messages.
- Instagram supports managing messages and responding to interactions.
- LinkedIn supports scheduling and publishing posts.
- X / Twitter supports scheduling posts and one-to-one contact via DM.
- TikTok supports publishing content and responding to comments.
- Threads supports sharing messages and interacting with the audience.
- WhatsApp supports one-to-one messaging and campaigns.

---

### Other communication channels

Other connected communication channels include:

- Live chat
- Chatbots

Important channel logic:

- Live chat can bring website conversations into the same handling environment.
- Chatbots can support automated conversations and may hand over to human agents.
- These conversations should still follow inbox, assignment, status, and ownership logic.

---

### Monitoring sources

Monitoring can cover:

- News
- Blogs
- Social platforms

Important monitoring logic:

- Monitoring is available for organisations in the Netherlands.
- Monitoring supports reputation management, crisis communication, brand tracking, and trend detection.
- AI-assisted query building helps teams create and refine queries.

